OL,3,AHoliday balcony inquest hears engineer
OL,4,Amay not have known he was falling to
OL,5,Ahis death
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquest at Caernarfon Coroner's
OL,8,FCourt heard there was no evidence of
OL,9,Fthird-party involvement, and coroner
OL,10,FElizabeth Dudley-Jones concluded his
OL,11,Fdeath was an accident.
